WEBVTT

00:00:00.035 --> 00:00:03.211 line:88% align:center
Why does the poop emoji look like ice cream
with self-confidence?

00:00:03.402 --> 00:00:07.705 line:88% align:center
The swirl comes from Japanese poop cartoons.
Yes, poop has a heritage.

00:00:07.902 --> 00:00:12.371 line:88% align:center
That smile? A cute face, not a toilet photo.
Thanks, designers.

00:00:12.568 --> 00:00:15.788 line:88% align:center
But here's the twist, from
an original Apple emoji designer:

00:00:15.935 --> 00:00:19.425 line:88% align:center
They made the poop first, then
reused the swirl for ice cream.

00:00:19.568 --> 00:00:22.650 line:88% align:center
Remove the eyes. Make it white.
Add a cone.

00:00:22.902 --> 00:00:27.200 line:88% align:center
This isn't ice cream that became poop.
It's ice cream with a criminal past.
